## The same in-process harness with the batch laid out as nghttp2 sends a burst: the 16 HEADERS frames of a read first,
## then its 16 DATA frames (BENCH_LAYOUT=burst). No DATA frame is behind its own HEADERS, so the fused request path
## never applies; what remains of the last step is the lookup skipped for a new stream id and the cache hit before the frame.

